    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναστρωφάω</span></b> , Frequentat. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναστρέφω, τόξον ἐνώμα πάντῃ ἀναστρωφῶν</span>
